Project Development Phase
LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator

Project Development Phase

1. Introduction

The Project Development Phase is the stage where the design and requirements of LegalEase are converted into a working application.

LegalEase is an AI-powered web application that helps users generate structured legal document drafts by selecting a document type and entering the required information. The system uses an AI model to prepare the draft, which the user can review, edit, and download.

> LegalEase is an AI-assisted drafting tool. Generated documents should be reviewed carefully and are not a substitute for professional legal advice.




---

2. Development Objectives

The main objectives during development are:

Create the LegalEase user interface.

Develop the document-selection system.

Create dynamic input forms.

Implement input validation.

Connect the application to an AI service.

Generate structured document drafts.

Provide document preview.

Allow users to edit and regenerate drafts.

Implement document download.

Add error handling and security measures.

Test all modules before final deployment.



