14. Document Generation

The application converts the final draft into a downloadable file.

Possible formats:

PDF

Useful for sharing and printing.

DOCX

Useful when the user wants to make further edits.

TXT

Useful for simple text-based output.

The generated document can contain:

Document title

Main content

Relevant sections

Date

Signature placeholders

Appropriate disclaimer



