17. Security Implementation

Security features are added during development.

API Key Protection

The API key should be stored in an environment file:

.env

It should not be directly written into frontend JavaScript or uploaded publicly to GitHub.

Other security measures

Input validation

Secure API communication

Controlled database access

Limited data storage

Appropriate privacy practices

Secure deployment configuration



