25. Conclusion

The Project Development Phase transforms the LegalEase requirements and design into a working AI-powered legal document drafting application.

The development process connects the frontend, backend, AI service, database, and document-generation modules into one system.

The final workflow is:

Select Document → Enter Details → Validate → AI Generate → Preview → Edit → Download

After completing development, the project moves to the Project Testing Phase, where the complete application is tested for functionality, accuracy, usability, security, and reliability.
